    "description": "## Proposed solution\n\nAdd a Checkbox field `Test__c` (label: Test) to Account and to Affiliate Link (Links__c). Not added to any page layout — set by admin or data load only.\n\nAccount covers the Operator, Partner, Player and Referrer record types.\n\n**Field Description** (both objects): \"Flags records created for testing or data import validation. Records with Test = True are excluded from operational reports. Set by admin or data load only — not exposed on page layouts.\"\n\n**Help Text:** n/a — not on page layouts.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n* Field exists on Account and on Affiliate Link, defaults to False, and does not appear on any page layout.\n\n",
